GIT PUSH — COMPLETE 2026 VERSION

From the project root:

1) Check changes
   git status

2) Stage all intended changes
   git add .

3) Review what is staged
   git status

4) Commit
   git commit -m "Update complete 2026 market intelligence chatbot with multi-file exposure loading"

5) Push
   git push origin main

If main is not tracking origin/main yet:
   git branch -M main
   git push -u origin main

DO NOT COMMIT:
- .env
- .streamlit/secrets.toml
- OpenRouter API keys
- Hugging Face tokens

STREAMLIT CLOUD SECRETS:
OPENROUTER_API_KEY = "..."
HF_TOKEN = "..."

MULTIPLE EXPOSURE INPUT FILES:
config/settings.yaml

paths:
  company_exposure_csv:
    - data/company_exposure_2026_part1.xlsx
    - data/company_exposure_2026_part2.xlsx

The application combines both files automatically on startup.
